msgstr "lecteurs (N2)"

msgid "Who issues, who signs, who reads"
msgstr "Qui émet, qui signe, qui lit"

msgid ""
"N1: every party of the call. N2: the issuer, the readers below and — unless "
"the readers are limited to that list — the agency, the harbour master, the "
"port management and the owner. N3: the issuer and one counterpart. A "
