msgstr "Signer pour le terminal"

msgid ""
"The signature is nominative and sealed; the second signature closes the "
"checklist, completes task M0:28 and records the milestone the start of "
"transfer waits for."
msgstr ""
"La signature est nominative et scellée ; la seconde signature clôt la liste,"
" termine la tâche M0:28 et enregistre le jalon qu'attend le début du "
"transfert."

msgid ""
"Signed by both sides; the repetitive checks continue during the transfer."
msgstr ""
"Signée par les deux parties ; les vérifications répétées se poursuivent "
"pendant le transfert."

msgid "The ship and the terminal sign; the other parties read."
msgstr "Le navire et le terminal signent ; les autres parties lisent."

