msgid ""
"GSV = GOV × VCF and weight = GSV × density are computed when you leave them "
"blank. The reading is shown to the other parties once the surveyor has "
"validated it."
msgstr ""
"GSV = GOV × VCF et masse = GSV × densité sont calculés si vous les laissez "
"vides. Le relevé est montré aux autres parties une fois validé par "
